{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6235512d-d824-4add-a78d-1cac64fb7a31",
    "name": "School Management API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the School Management ASP.NET Core API.\n\nCovers Health, Auth, Users, Classes, Subjects, Teacher Assignments, Enrollments, Assignments, Submissions, Dashboard, Notifications, and Settings.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Start the API (`dotnet run` in `backend`) — default base URL is `http://localhost:5000`.\n2. Run Login requests first so tokens are saved to collection variables.\n3. Seeded IDs are prefilled as collection variables (see DbSeeder).\n\n**Seeded credentials**\n- Admin: `admin@school.com` / `Admin123!`\n- Teacher: `teacher@school.com` / `Teacher123!`\n- Student: `student1@school.com` / `Student123!`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/Health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "Health"]
            },
            "description": "Anonymous health check."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login - Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', data.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('bearerToken', data.token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (data.user && data.user.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('adminId', data.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@school.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate as Admin and save JWT."
          },
          "response": []
        },
